Package: lsd-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Linux Simple Diagnostic <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Recommends: systemd
Suggests: lsd-agent
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Linux Simple Diagnostic server (metrics storage, API and web UI)
 Receives metrics from Linux Simple Diagnostic agents over gRPC, stores them in
 an embedded time-series database and serves the web UI and API on port 8090.
 Installed in /opt/lsd/server and run as a systemd service.
